# Gate step — data, not code (order 1072-b7eq). Moved from an inline build.sh
# --check block by the .step series (batch 4: the next slowest blocks,
# measured one at a time on lenovinha). As a .step it is no build.sh edit, so it
# never makes intake HEAVY; it runs in the pool (it writes only its own scratch).
#
# Order 614-2gqx / 651-2x5s. The durable MO-FULL attestation ledger
# (plan/mo-full-attestations.d/) must never carry a tampered, fabricated,
# or unreachable marker — the terminal marker is only as strong as the
# record that outlives the transcript it was emitted into.
STEP_DESC="Checking the durable MO-FULL attestation ledger (614-2gqx)"
STEP_SCRIPT="scripts/check-mo-full-attestations.sh"
STEP_ERROR="the MO-FULL attestation ledger records a marker that is fabricated, tampered, or unreachable (plan/mo-full-attestations.d/)"
STEP_OK="MO-FULL attestation ledger check passed"
STEP_SECOND_REGIME="tlatoanis-macbook-air 2026-11-23 darwin ok:mo-full-attestations:10 files 877 markers at 35680bdf4 (run directly, idle host)"
STEP_READS="scripts/check-mo-full-attestations.sh"
